    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "text": "For SFO–Bangkok on January 15, the most straightforward award choice is a one-ticket economy itinerary that leaves late that evening and reaches Bangkok the morning of January 17. If getting in earlier matters more than avoiding a much earlier start, another one-ticket economy option arrives late on January 16. A third possibility reaches business class, but it requires a separate positioning flight to Los Angeles and a far earlier departure from San Francisco.",
      "label": null,
      "reference_kind": null,
      "canonical_id": null,
      "journey": null,
      "component": null,
      "lead": null,
      "unavailable": false
    },
